&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate repetitive modeling tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scripts for data analysis and model validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance overall efficiency in MBSE workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
