&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python Proficiency: &lt;/strong&gt;Intermediate Python skills (1+ year of experience to include college experience) with the ability to automate tasks, perform data analysis, and develop scripts for model validation, utilizing libraries and frameworks relevant to MBSE.&lt;/li&gt;
